      "headingRaw": "Five-character-regular-verseDuFuTOLIBAIATTHESKYSEND",
      "translationRaw": "Acoldwindblowsfromthefarsky。。。。Whatareyouthinkingof，oldfriend？Thewildgeeseneveranswerme。Riversandlakesarefloodedwithrain。。。。Apoetshouldbewareofprosperity，Yetdemonscanhauntawanderer。Askanunhappyghost，throwpoemstohimWherehedrownedhimselfintheMiloRiver。",
